{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C5XNfYvWPxZRkKdzPKfiKA","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"latest stable Python release python.org downloads\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Download Python\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Source Releases\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/source/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Releases for Windows\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/getit/windows/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Release Python 3.15.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Release Python 3.14.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3140/\"},{\"title\":\"Welcome to Python.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Releases for macOS\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Release Python 3.13.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3130/\"},{\"title\":\"Python documentation by version\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/doc/versions/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Release Python 3.13.16\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31316/\"}]\n\nThe latest stable release on python.org is **Python 3.15.0**, released October 9, 2026. The downloads page lists it first among active releases, and the home page calls it the latest. The python.org home page also reports a Python 3.16.0 alpha 1 release on October 13, 2026, which is a pre-release, not a stable version.\n\nOlder branches are still maintained. Per the documentation index, 3.14.8 came out September 30, 2026, and 3.13.16 on the same date, which the 3.13.16 release page describes as the last full maintenance release for 3.13. The downloads page lists 3.14 and 3.13 as bugfix branches, so the 3.14 series is current, but these listings don't all agree on point-release numbers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"129bc11f-085d-4635-9fbf-316df5dae751","uuid":"28f17524-3e68-4789-8f57-d055363da385","timestamp":"2026-10-17T01:04:14.497Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"latest stable Python release python.org downloads","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01XNLPMgxiX5EUwZrqoRn1bB","content":[{"title":"Download Python","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/"},{"title":"Python Source Releases","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/source/"},{"title":"Python Releases for Windows","url":"https://www.python.org/getit/windows/"},{"title":"Python Release Python 3.15.0","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/"},{"title":"Python Release Python 3.14.0","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3140/"},{"title":"Welcome to Python.org","url":"https://www.python.org/"},{"title":"Python Releases for macOS","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/"},{"title":"Python Release Python 3.13.0","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3130/"},{"title":"Python documentation by version","url":"https://www.python.org/doc/versions/"},{"title":"Python Release Python 3.13.16","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31316/"}]},"The latest stable release on python.org is **Python 3.15.0**, released October 9, 2026. The downloads page lists it first among active releases, and the home page calls it the latest. The python.org home page also reports a Python 3.16.0 alpha 1 release on October 13, 2026, which is a pre-release, not a stable version.\n\nOlder branches are still maintained. Per the documentation index, 3.14.8 came out September 30, 2026, and 3.13.16 on the same date, which the 3.13.16 release page describes as the last full maintenance release for 3.13. The downloads page lists 3.14 and 3.13 as bugfix branches, so the 3.14 series is current, but these listings don't all agree on point-release numbers."],"durationSeconds":4.919679745,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_